you made a lot of money off that.

4
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,400
Does money buy happiness?

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:06,940
No.

6
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:09,760
I think there's a certain level that money does.

7
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:10,980
I mean, I grew up very poor.

8
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:13,630
I roofed houses as a child in the Texas

9
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:16,000
heat to help my dad and then later washing dishes

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:16,600
with my mother.

11
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,540
Yes, money definitely bought happiness when

12
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:20,260
